{"id":"ccbc15:problem:1-1","answer":"GUNDAM","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>你需要利用不同的密码破译这些内容！从上至下的加密类型分别是：盲文、摩斯、旗语、猪笔、手机九键、凯撒。你可以在网上搜索到这些密码对应的码表和使用方式。</p>","text":"你需要利用不同的密码破译这些内容！从上至下的加密类型分别是：盲文、摩斯、旗语、猪笔、手机九键、凯撒。你可以在网上搜索到这些密码对应的码表和使用方式。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>你有注意到有一个特定的字母被标记了吗？从上到下按顺序念他们就可以得到答案哦。</p>","text":"你有注意到有一个特定的字母被标记了吗？从上到下按顺序念他们就可以得到答案哦。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>行数</th>\n<th>加密方式</th>\n<th>密文</th>\n<th>原文</th>\n<th>提取</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>盲文</td>\n<td>⠑⠁⠛⠇⠑⠎</td>\n<td>eagles</td>\n<td>G</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>莫尔斯电码</td>\n<td>-/.-./..-/--/.-/-.</td>\n<td>truman</td>\n<td>U</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>旗语</td>\n<td><img data-asset-id=\"asset-4cec104d48094e2cee138e1c\" height=\"21\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/1/fa057893a7364ab9a181a4476a583862.webp\"/></td>\n<td>agency</td>\n<td>N</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>猪圈</td>\n<td><img data-asset-id=\"asset-c2a78c6a4e4dab79e4dd7277\" height=\"21\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/1/2fe12be0fb4f4fc68a8f9ea89373f8ce.webp\"/></td>\n<td>defeat</td>\n<td>D</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>九键</td>\n<td>22 63 22 23 21 81</td>\n<td>bobcat</td>\n<td>A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>ROT13</td>\n<td>z n a h n y</td>\n<td>manual</td>\n<td>M</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>最终答案为 <strong>GUNDAM</strong></p>","text":"行数\n\n加密方式\n\n密文\n\n原文\n\n提取\n\n1\n\n盲文\n\n⠑⠁⠛⠇⠑⠎\n\neagles\n\nG\n\n2\n\n莫尔斯电码\n\n-/.-./..-/--/.-/-.\n\ntruman\n\nU\n\n3\n\n旗语\n\nagency\n\nN\n\n4\n\n猪圈\n\ndefeat\n\nD\n\n5\n\n九键\n\n22 63 22 23 21 81\n\nbobcat\n\nA\n\n6\n\nROT13\n\nz n a h n y\n\nmanual\n\nM\n\n最终答案为\nGUNDAM","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-4cec104d48094e2cee138e1c","asset-c2a78c6a4e4dab79e4dd7277"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"t